        "interaction_type_slug": "choice",
        "item_body": "<h3>Canary heading three</h3><h4>Canary heading four</h4><p>Paragraph with <strong>strong</strong>, <em>em</em>, <b>b</b>, <i>i</i>, <u>u</u>, x<sup>2</sup>, H<sub>2</sub>O, and inline <code>print(x)</code>.<br>Line after a br.</p><ul>\n<li>Unordered one</li>\n<li>Unordered two</li>\n</ul><ol>\n<li>Ordered one</li>\n<li>Ordered two</li>\n</ol><p><a href=\"/courses/121046/pages/cse-field-probe-page-html-canaries-2026-10-10\">Relative course page link</a> and <a href=\"https://www.python.org/\">external link</a>.</p><table>\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Input</th>\n<th>Output</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">Spans both columns</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://inst-fs-iad-prod.inscloudgate.net/files/98f1f310-5c72-4776-841f-cdfda6aa84be/2bears1.png?token=REDACTED\" alt=\"Canary course image\" data-old-link=\"/courses/121046/files/18945746/preview\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Centered with an inline style.</p><p>LaTeX as typed: \\(x^2 + 3x = 10\\)</p><p>Equation image: <img class=\"equation_image\" title=\"x^2\" src=\"/equation_images/x%255E2?scale=1\" alt=\"LaTeX: x^2\" data-equation-content=\"x^2\"></p><pre style=\"background-color:#272822;color:#F8F8F2;padding:12px;border-radius:6px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;display:block;\"><code><span style=\"color:#66D9EF\">if</span> x <span style=\"color:#F92672\">&lt;</span> <span style=\"color:#AE81FF\">10</span> <span style=\"color:#F92672\">and</span> y <span style=\"color:#F92672\">&gt;</span> <span style=\"color:#AE81FF\">2</span>:\n    print(<span style=\"color:#E6DB74\">\"a &amp; b\"</span>)</code></pre><p>Paragraph with an onclick attribute.</p>",
